<title>NETHERLANDS: Vilenzo details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Vilenzo details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textiles group Vilenzo said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 25 held.</p>
<p>In April, Vilenzo announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.90 guilders. The payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Vilenzo shares closed at 49.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday, up 2.10 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
